  "content": "<h1>更美的天空</h1>\n<h3>星雲效果</h3>\n<p>此模組會根據世界種子/伺服器生成獨特的天空盒，100%即時運算呈現出類光影效果的絢麗星雲。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/57519662/207486041-0547425d-da33-47eb-8e37-ca3e94ea9f2d.png\" alt=\"2022-11-07_15 12 41\"></p>\n<h3>星星渲染</h3>\n<p>星星會閃爍並呈現細微的顏色差異</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fuser-images.githubusercontent.com%252f57519662%252f195574727-11e11ce6-73b6-4786-b6cf-4e38d4b5cd26.mp4\" rel=\"nofollow\">點此觀看示範影片！</a></p>\n<h3>光照貼圖調整</h3>\n<p>根據個人偏好微調了光照貼圖，使色彩更鮮明且暗部更深沉，最終版本將會把這些調整設為可選功能。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/57519662/195578328-053f5d84-a9db-4e44-a4a7-4ecc4f25af37.gif\" alt=\"lightmap\"></p>\n<h2>光影相容性</h2>\n<p>本模組<strong>不支援</strong>多數光影包，但可與<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/complementary-reimagined\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complementary Reimagined</a>相容。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/57519662/207485708-534ad8fd-72eb-4204-a754-985edaaf2c24.png\" alt=\"使用comp reimagined的畫面截圖\"></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
